cinity, nearby area","ex":"집 근처에 편의점이 있어요.","x":"There's a convenience store near my house.","e":"Literally 'near place'.","t":"Pattern: noun + 근처에 = near the noun, e.g. 학교 근처에.","parts":[["근","near"],["처","place"]],"rel":[["가깝다","to be close"],["주변","surroundings"],["옆","next to"]],"a":["b000.mp3",2401536,2208,2403744,9696],"nb":["밑","안","밖","사이","오른쪽","왼쪽","가운데","건너편"]}],"신발":[{"id":"T1-331","de":"신발","rom":"sinbal","pos":"noun","lv":"T1","pr":null,"forms":"신발이 · 신발을","m":"shoes, footwear","ex":"한국 집에서는 신발을 벗어요.","x":"In Korean homes you take off your shoes.","e":"신 (shoe) + 발 (foot). 신다 is also for socks.","t":"Put shoes on with 신다 and take them off with 벗다.","parts":[],"rel":[["신다","to put on (shoes)"],["운동화","sneakers"],["구두","dress shoes"]],"a":["b001.mp3",434976,2592,437568,9024],"nb":["티셔츠","원피스","코트","양말","구두","운동화","모자","가방"]}],"울다":[{"id":"T1-569","de":"울다","rom":"ulda","pos":"verb","lv":"T1","pr":null,"forms":"울어요 · 울었어요 · 울 거예요 · 우세요 (ㄹ drops)","m":"to cry, to weep; to sing (birds), to make a sound (animals)","ex":"슬픈 영화를 보고 많이 울었어요.","x":"I cried a lot after watching a sad movie.","e":"Also for animal and bird sounds; 울음 = crying. Don't confuse with 웃다 (laugh).","t":"ㄹ drops before ㄴ, ㅂ, ㅅ: 우세요, 우는 아이 (a crying child).","parts":[],"rel":[["웃다","to laugh"],["슬프다","to be sad"],["눈물","tears"]],"a":["b002.mp3",77472,2304,79776,8928],"nb":["이야기하다","묻다","대답하다","웃다","노래하다","춤추다","여행하다","산책하다"]}],"심심하다":[{"id":"T1-706","de":"심심하다","rom":"simsimhada","pos":"adjective","lv":"T1","pr":null,"forms":"심심해요 · 심심했어요 · 심심한 (+noun)","m":"bored, boring (having nothing to do)","ex":"주말에 혼자 있어서 심심해요.","x":"I'm bored because I'm alone on the weekend.","e":"Also means 'a bit bland' for food. 심심해요 = I'm bored.","t":"심심하다 = bored because there's nothing to do; a boring movie is 재미없다.","parts":[],"rel":[["재미없다","to be uninteresting"],["재미있다","to be fun"],["바쁘다","to be busy"]],"a":["b002.mp3",1571904,3168,1575072,8448],"nb":["싫다","반갑다","고맙다","미안하다","늦다","아주","정말","진짜"]}],"계산":[{